# ── Internal bug-bounty lane (never public) ──
# Explicit denylist so BB coverage is structural, not incidental to `scripts/*`.
# The trailing test re-exclusion overrides the `!scripts/test_*.py` allowlist above
# (a later gitignore rule wins) so the impact-map seam test never enters the public tree.
